{"id":192,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Sunflora converts solar energy into nutrition. It moves around actively in the daytime when it is warm. It stops moving as soon as the sun goes down for the night."},{"games":["Y","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"As the hot season approaches, the petals on this Pokémon’s face become more vivid and lively."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Since it converts sunlight into energy, it is always looking in the direction of the sun."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"In the daytime, it rushes about in a hectic manner, but it comes to a complete stop when the sun sets."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It converts sunlight into energy. In the darkness after sunset, it closes its petals and becomes still."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"SUNFLORA convert solar energy into nutrition. They are highly active in the warm daytime but suddenly stop moving as soon as the sun sets."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Solar Power","hidden":false,"description":"In harsh sunlight, the Pokémon's Sp. Atk stat is boosted, but its HP decreases every turn."},{"name":"Early Bird","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon awakens from sleep twice as fast as other Pokémon."}],"eggGroups":["Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Yellow","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":191,"name":"Sunkern","condition":null,"children":[{"id":192,"name":"Sunflora","condition":"Use Sun Stone","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,1],[1,33],[1,74],[4,275],[7,71],[10,72],[13,73],[16,75],[19,388],[22,202],[25,331],[28,80],[31,76],[34,38],[39,241],[43